{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54233","headline":"六合怀古诗 塔山二首 一 · 郏滂","name":"六合怀古诗 塔山二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"此山元以形如塔，贞观年中改叠层（《光绪志》作「成」）。\n圭字峰尖真似画，塔名不语爲高增（《光绪志》作「河僧」）。\n（〖1〗《嘉靖志》注：「嘉定志。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郏滂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54233.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54233","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}